      "Set controller.base_speed to about 1.5 (not 1.2). Iteration 0 reached only 0.10 to 0.15 progress at 1.6 with a 3 s limit, so 1.2 cannot finish; 1.5 keeps the average speed near the roughly 1.5 m/s that completion needs.",
